OL,3,AUS death row inmate Christa Pike awake
OL,4,Aand speaking after failed execution,
OL,5,Alawyers say
OL,6,
OL,7,FPike, who was sentenced to death after
OL,8,Fmurdering Colleen Slemmer with her
OL,9,Fthen-boyfriend in 1995, survived two
OL,10,Flethal injections on 30 September in
OL,11,FTennessee.
OL,13,FExperts and her legal team say her
OL,14,Fapparent recovery is unprecedented.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/40
