OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AResidents of kibbutz destroyed in 7
OL,4,AOctober Hamas-led attacks grapple with
OL,5,Ahow to rebuild
OL,6,
OL,7,FBy the glass entrance doors, dotted
OL,8,Fwith bullet holes, there is a shocking
OL,9,Freminder of what happened to the
OL,10,Fmissing residents.
OL,12,FThe postboxes for each household bear
OL,13,Fstickers put there after the attacks
OL,14,Fthree years ago: red indicates those
OL,15,Fkilled, and black those taken hostage.
OL,16,F"That's one out of four of us: murdered
OL,17,For kidnapped," Dalit says. "Including
OL,18,Fchildren and babies."
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/40
